/links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/KVuH0w4OZAAXVoeodFRiPxMSQa87_yaZuuXVl4yG14Xc-4Gdr3pdR_a48cwh68V_XsP6zftGbJrwricoQes4Oi7PtZyD5GfxIS14KPYls4h-nTZ11HPRe_dGLCXrUhnHckMnak14SO58ZoG4LrpdSlT_PvZMAshg-SDxvdNTKX9alEs5wL3sSsYb4-AACl-rNl9ilmcebjOQssmsRpCdSWthMNPooggGa7d9vdt5MQSZNWpbtMejuUvwwFmt2iX1IB7NVTiR-HTRsjhcfOKvapAlPGJqRKpvjbt7HyJmqw-mT7VxZnehp0r32A/V5wkUKpM7U8inDshJ-B9KCDaih2-e_b3/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="丹尼尔·科汉 |师资 |水稻人民 |莱斯大学"&gt;丹尼尔·科汉&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align: center; font-style: italic; font-weight: 400; margin: 0;"&gt;莱斯大学土木与环境工程教授估计，石油和天然气生产引起的耀斑每年导致美国数十人过早死亡。 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 30px; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid; margin-top: 40px;"&gt;近距离观察气候变化&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;作者： &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/DHSvRUSx1oHw94tb_ZofVtNnrdNmkBnQDRYcHZyh3CBIloYUyqtPIVdJaask0wCW9VyxErZLRG0fzn493UguHony9WcpVwFPcBGy9KlxeTvYtNXWviW2ele5QlWSVqVR30tTTqFNWDq--8HSZJhq1YlVSXePpwEPpp3rAxT78XFl2rodG5RXY5jNI6uDJ27Uw0jgohkbsT87P1oPvTWJpz9PfrCWM9cbrD5WbxMITZXUigttbef0yoz9384lweCHypzXd4po4BwxC--Uo2VjhI-1tAnhtsal9gkhY2-Qt3mDzVV9ayTHmbmFtSaWFDvh7nEtnYBXD2L5z7brbeB7Fr7u_TaxV8Ba90bq91JXbFTtGVNIGUPpKmS_lzTfMNzbR6IeCZAP3w9vzjC9HMwFXROabNXRm8y2ouFHmlV03UkdoepUat2eiLLYdfQ7yv7gfvxrLqGxpv0XAZdyq9eEh7pf1BuRL1wZHO5UdcHKB3VC8d4v/HV4qCeWy7K3_Kv0NybEgzUN0jKByYVZR/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="David Stringer - 气候与 ESG 总编辑 | David Stringer彭博社"&gt;大卫·斯金格&lt;/a&gt;和&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/DpJZgdxvA2APJDlkA3_VTVqWHdkaeGmB-iZOtma5xLrXdKL_tvrr0aVpB7NimyQ7BnZk3P_TlRENOLnbkwVjtEY12Kr7gv-nIjfdSAn1iMBiUvVAHD9I2J3LTtqomo4slZ5MJ3A2iPkJlJgPL1ZgwMMxDyjKhbNY8z4iM3ipnf60ZphjEa6ls7mOCrnbzpJ2spiGQ1KKR6FYAoSh38csCtj8IRLTL-85xukL0UP9Ea1XFBwW1zXKWOFX8hHhIdHL__UWBlzwD9F9TkSHdb-jXJEuGs4-VcAEAQzKtKlExlj00Jh4wFzmzroWDZ